{
  "source": "course-assets/navigate-the-future-opener/navigate-the-future-opener.mp4",
  "duration": 139.3066875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.38,
      "text": "You've put in the time to learn the mechanics."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.98,
      "end": 4.42,
      "text": "You now know how to use AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.42,
      "end": 6.6,
      "text": "and you understand the engine underneath,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.98,
      "end": 10.2,
      "text": "which means it's strange behavior finally makes sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.06,
      "end": 12.92,
      "text": "You've achieved the core goal of this course."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.54,
      "end": 15.14,
      "text": "You are now smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.3,
      "end": 17.96,
      "text": "So that brings us to the question"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.96,
      "end": 20.54,
      "text": "almost everyone is arguing about right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.94,
      "end": 22.48,
      "text": "Where does all this actually land?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.04,
      "end": 24.84,
      "text": "You've definitely heard the voices already."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.22,
      "end": 27.3,
      "text": "You probably know an AI optimist"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.3,
      "end": 30.32,
      "text": "who thinks this technology is amazing, fantastic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 32.32,
      "text": "and worthy of every other superlative"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.32,
      "end": 33.32,
      "text": "they can string together."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.7,
      "end": 36.86,
      "text": "And you know an AI warrior who is absolutely certain"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.86,
      "end": 38.1,
      "text": "it's going to hurt society."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 39.88,
      "text": "Here's the honest part."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.54,
      "end": 41.44,
      "text": "Nobody knows."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.04,
      "end": 45.3,
      "text": "Not them, not us, not the people building AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.02,
      "end": 47.18,
      "text": "Think back to history class."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.84,
      "end": 50.04,
      "text": "Centuries ago, map makers had to figure out"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.04,
      "end": 51.92,
      "text": "what to do with vast stretches of ocean"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.92,
      "end": 53.3,
      "text": "they simply did not understand."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.9,
      "end": 56.54,
      "text": "Their solution was to fill those uncharted waters"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.54,
      "end": 59.06,
      "text": "with imagined sea monsters and strange serpents."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.76,
      "end": 65.86,
      "text": "The future of AI is exactly like the unknown parts of the ocean on those old maps. The"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.86,
      "end": 70.82,
      "text": "AI warriors look out at that blank space and draw modern monsters. They picture a"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.82,
      "end": 76.46,
      "text": "technology that destroys jobs, hacks systems, and takes over the world. Meanwhile, AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.46,
      "end": 81.98,
      "text": "optimists stare at the exact same unknown waters and see only easy, clear sailing"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.98,
      "end": 83.1,
      "text": "through open channels."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.6,
      "end": 87.54,
      "text": "But look at what those early sailors actually found when they pushed past the edge."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.02,
      "end": 89.12,
      "text": "They didn't run into sea monsters."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.58,
      "end": 91.86,
      "text": "And they very rarely got easy, clear sailing."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.52,
      "end": 95.64,
      "text": "What they usually encountered was something completely unexpected."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.66,
      "end": 100.1,
      "text": "Throughout this section, we are going to take both views of our map seriously."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.48,
      "end": 104.62,
      "text": "The very real risks of the monsters and the genuine benefits of the open water."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.22,
      "end": 107.2,
      "text": "As we do, only one thing is certain."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.72,
      "end": 108.9,
      "text": "AI is here to stay."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.9,
      "end": 113.98,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it keeps getting better forever, just that the technology isn't going away."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.7,
      "end": 117.42,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.16,
      "end": 121.46,
      "text": "One, why do people disagree so much about AI's future?"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.2,
      "end": 126.56,
      "text": "Two, what could AI do to make society better, and where could it go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.14,
      "end": 131.2,
      "text": "And three, how could AI change my future life and work?"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.9,
      "end": 136.04,
      "text": "Nobody has a map of what's coming. You're ready to sail into the blank space."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.9,
      "end": 139.14,
      "text": "you"
    }
  ],
